      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar. Note: the global CLAUDE.md (~/.claude/CLAUDE.md) instructs redaction of client company names, contract amounts, AWS account IDs/ARNs, client-identifying domains, and NDA business info in all outputs — treat those categories as sensitive within this user's workflow",
